claims:
1. A device comprising:
a processor functional unit having a predetermined vector size; and
a cache memory controller coupled to the processor functional unit and capable of:
receiving a set of parameters associated with a first set of data;
retrieving the first set of data;
in a first mode of operation, producing a second set of data by duplicating the first set of data by a first amount that is based on the predetermined vector size of the processor functional unit;
in a second mode of operation, producing the second set of data by duplicating the first set of data by a second amount that is based on the set of parameters irrespective of the predetermined vector size of the processor functional unit; and
providing the second set of data to the processor functional unit.

11. A device comprising:
a memory capable of storing a set of data;
a processor that includes a vector unit that has a prede- termined vector size; and
a memory controller coupled between the memory and the processor, wherein the processor is capable of causing the memory controller to:
retrieve a first set of data from the memory;
in a first mode of operation, perform a first duplication operation on the first set of data to produce a second set of data according to a first duplication factor that is based on the predetermined vector size;
in a second mode of operation, perform a second duplication operation on the first set of data to produce the second set of data according to a second duplication factor that is independent of the prede- termined vector size; and
provide the second set of data to the processor.

18. A method comprising:
retrieving, from a memory, a first set of data;
determining whether to produce a second set of data by duplicating the first set of data by a first amount that is based on a predetermined vector size of a processor or by a second amount that is independent of the prede- termined vector size of the processor;
producing the second set of data; and
providing the second set of data to the processor.

